{"2721360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Laws", "steam_appid": 2721360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is straightforward but dangerous: kill, loot, and extract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.poster.avif?t=1764765397\" width=598 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.webm?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.mp4?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the realm of Dark Laws, where Telos Island awaits you. Step into the open world, a battleground set for heart-pounding adventures, where survival is a testament written in blood, loot serves as the currency of the bold, and extraction is the only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.poster.avif?t=1764765397\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.webm?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.mp4?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own destiny. Choose from deadly melee weapons, precision ranged instruments, arcane spells, and passive relics that enhance your abilities. But the arsenal doesn't end there – command the skies with a dragonhorn to summon your majestic dragon, turning the tide of battle in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices are endless; the consequences deadly.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is straightforward but dangerous: kill, loot, and extract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.poster.avif?t=1764765397\" width=598 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.webm?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/59652d52bdc164096880a72f7c97f180.mp4?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the realm of Dark Laws, where Telos Island awaits you. Step into the open world, a battleground set for heart-pounding adventures, where survival is a testament written in blood, loot serves as the currency of the bold, and extraction is the only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.poster.avif?t=1764765397\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.webm?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/extras/e81bd422d8601b0bb55384f7b8c66e7d.mp4?t=1764765397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own destiny. Choose from deadly melee weapons, precision ranged instruments, arcane spells, and passive relics that enhance your abilities. But the arsenal doesn't end there – command the skies with a dragonhorn to summon your majestic dragon, turning the tide of battle in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices are endless; the consequences deadly.</p>", "short_description": "Dark Laws is a medieval fantasy extraction looter with melee, ranged, and spell-based combat. Choose one of 9 mercenaries, mount a dragon alone or with a friend, and survive the brutality of enemies on Telos Island.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/header.jpg?t=1764765397", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764765397", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764765397", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str